ata-source=\"Pickaxe Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickaxe Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$0</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Pre-release</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Wooden Pickaxe</b> was a pickaxe that new players were supposed to recieve at the start of the game. It was supposed to be worst pickaxe in the game, being also sold at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>.\n</p><p>This pickaxe was removed very early on in development due to being unneeded, as it barely had any significant stat differences compared to the <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Pickaxe\" title=\"Rusty Pickaxe\">Rusty Pickaxe</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p><b>Wooden pickaxe</b> is a short sized pick, sharing it's model with <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Pickaxe\" title=\"Rusty Pickaxe\">Rusty Pickaxe</a>. It's headpiece is made out of gray wood, using the default legacy wood material. It's handle is covered in black bandages acting as an improvised grip, while being made out of typical dark brown wood, using the default legacy wood material.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This tool is a part of the group of removed starter tools. Those being the <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Axe\" title=\"Wooden Axe\">Wooden Axe</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Chisel\" title=\"Wooden Chisel\">Wooden Chisel</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Saw\" title=\"Wooden Saw\">Wooden Saw</a></li>\n<li>Unlike looking like it was made out of stone, it's actually wooden. Early model of it looked entirely wooden.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163813\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 110/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 587/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 93/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019512/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.819      1 -total\n 90.69%   35.206      1 Template:Pickaxe\n  9.18%    3.563      1 Template:Removed\n  3.56%    1.382      1 Template:Mainonly\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:1402-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163813 and revision id 10434. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Removed","Tools","Pickaxes"],"links":[{"title":"Rusty Pickaxe","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true},{"title":"Wooden Axe","exists":true},{"title":"Wooden Chisel","exists":true},{"title":"Wooden Saw","exists":true}],"images":["StonePickaxe.png","BoxedStonePickaxe.png"]}
